This is a placeholder. The real ONNX model file
(wav2vec2-small-antideepfake.onnx, ~377 MB) is not included in this
repository.

To enable real ML inference:
1. Obtain the real Wav2Vec2 AntiDeepfake ONNX model file.
2. Place it at: ml/models/antideepfake/wav2vec2-small-antideepfake.onnx
3. Restart the backend. It will automatically detect the real model
   and stop using the demo heuristic fallback.

